"""
VoyageAI Reference Data — Single Source of Truth
=================================================
All lookup tables for airports, airlines, currencies, countries, routes,
visa categories and timezone data.

This file is the MASTER DATA SOURCE. The loader (load_reference_data.py)
reads from here and writes to the SQLite DB. The ReferenceCache then
reads from the DB at startup. Edit HERE, then run the loader.

Sections:
  AIRPORTS       — 250+ entries: IATA → {name, city, country_code, lat, lon, timezone}
  AIRLINES       — 100+ entries: IATA → {name, country_code, alliance, hub}
  CURRENCIES     — 70+ entries: ISO 4217 → {name, symbol, decimals}
  COUNTRIES      — 85+ entries: ISO 3166-2 → {name, currency, main_airport, region, visa_on_arrival_gb}
  GBP_RATES      — fallback exchange rates (GBP base, updated quarterly)
  CITY_ALIASES   — extra name variants pointing to IATA codes
  POPULAR_ROUTES — common UK departure routes with base pricing tiers
"""

